<VI _name="ot-spectra-to-flexlogger-test.vi" description="Unit-test harness for OT Spectra to FlexLogger.vi, fed block by block by the S&amp;V order power spectrum chain of the NI example (Analog Tacho Process, Convert to Even Angle, Order Power Spectrum). Synthesises accel (sum of order sines, peak amplitudes, uniform noise) and a 1 ppr 0-5 V square tach (rising edge at shaft angle 0) for rpm(t) = Base RPM + sum of linear ramps, cuts it into 0.1 s blocks (5120 S @ 51.2 kS/s) and calls OrderPowerSpectrum.vi block by block like FlexLogger Process.vi does (Data In = [accel, tach], reset? TRUE on block 0). Returns NUMERIC arrays only: Values [blocks x (2 + order ranges)] = RPM, order amplitudes (g rms), Spectrum Valid, True RPM at each block centre.">
